# clause — top-level binary

The `clause` binary ties together the compiler phases (lex, syntax,
resolve, typecheck, schedule, codegen) into a single shippable tool.
Consumes its sibling crates; no algorithmic content lives here.

Consumer-facing subcommands live here (compile, check, build, new).
Phase crate split + responsibilities finalised by Phase 2b (R1)
design round.
